      "bodyHtml": "<p>Using special reports in the Jaxicloud Fleet Management system, a dispatcher can analyze the vehicle’s actual fuel consumption for a given period, compare the value with the standard, and instantly assess savings and fuel consumption for each individual vehicle and for the entire fleet.</p>",
