      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p>After the fuel management system is customized to your needs, you can receive notifications about fuel refills and thefts via email, SMS and push notifications on your smartphone using the Jaxicloud Fleet Management native mobile app available for Android and iOS, and view information about the current fuel level on the vehicle. Those who prefer real-time tracking can use the Dashboard app to track relevant KPIs in real-time mode.</p>",
